	(descr "Amphenol RJE1D18821401 shielded RJ45 8P8C jack, right-angle THT, tab-down, no LEDs, no magnetics. Per user's direct reading of datasheet p-rje1d-188-x1x01.pdf rev B. Layout along Y-axis (opening to back): PCB edge at Y=-8.8; Ø1.57 plated shield tails at Y=-6.79 (14.85mm spacing, GND); Ø3.00 NPTH plastic locating posts at Y=0 (10.00mm spacing, origin datum); front pin row (odd 1,3,5,7) Ø0.9 at Y=+3.96; back pin row (even 2,4,6,8) Ø0.9 at Y=+6.50. Rows staggered by 1.27mm in X. Pin 1 at (-4.445,+3.96), Pin 8 at (+4.445,+6.50). Origin at midpoint between Ø3.00 locating posts.")
	(tags "amphenol rje1d18821401 rj45 8p8c shielded modular jack thru-hole right-angle cat5e")
